[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 19.06,
    "text": " Welcome, everybody, to this month's edition of the Creativity Corner."
  },
  {
    "start": 19.52,
    "end": 24.34,
    "text": " I'm Katherine, Mentor-Trainer for Positive Approach to Care, and today I am joined by"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.34,
    "end": 26.68,
    "text": " my good friend, Brian LeBlanc."
  },
  {
    "start": 27.22,
    "end": 27.78,
    "text": " Hi, Brian."
  },
  {
    "start": 27.78,
    "end": 29.560000000000002,
    "text": " Hi, Katherine."
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 32.62,
    "text": " Thanks for joining us."
  },
  {
    "start": 33.48,
    "end": 36.12,
    "text": " Well, thank you for bringing me on."
  },
  {
    "start": 36.24,
    "end": 37.24,
    "text": " I appreciate that."
  },
  {
    "start": 37.54,
    "end": 38.0,
    "text": " You bet."
  },
  {
    "start": 38.74,
    "end": 43.76,
    "text": " So this month, the theme is about socializing and being social."
  },
  {
    "start": 44.54,
    "end": 52.42,
    "text": " And in these times, it's been a little hard to be social, especially when what you do"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.42,
    "end": 56.96,
    "text": " to be creative generally involves other people, or often does."
  },
  {
    "start": 57.5,
    "end": 59.96,
    "text": " So, Brian, tell us a little bit about yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": 60.0,
    "end": 71.96000000000001,
    "text": " Well, it was in 2000, October of 2014, when I was diagnosed with early onset Alzheimer's"
  },
  {
    "start": 71.96000000000001,
    "end": 86.38,
    "text": " disease, I had lost my dad to vascular dementia, my grandfather to Alzheimer's, and my mother"
  },
  {
    "start": 86.38,
    "end": 89.48,
    "text": " was in the last stages of her..."
  },
  {
    "start": 89.48,
    "end": 89.98,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 90.0,
    "end": 98.74,
    "text": " ...of her journey with Alzheimer's, and she passed away three months after I was diagnosed."
  },
  {
    "start": 98.74,
    "end": 99.5,
    "text": " Mm-hmm."
  },
  {
    "start": 99.5,
    "end": 111.12,
    "text": " I knew, and I knew that what I wanted to do is to talk."
  },
  {
    "start": 111.12,
    "end": 118.03999999999999,
    "text": " I mean, I talk to anyone and anybody that will listen."
  },
  {
    "start": 118.03999999999999,
    "end": 119.08,
    "text": " I just..."
  },
  {
    "start": 119.08,
    "end": 119.58,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 119.58,
    "end": 120.2,
    "text": " I just..."
  },
  {
    "start": 120.2,
    "end": 122.67999999999999,
    "text": " That's what I've done most of my life."
  },
  {
    "start": 123.46,
    "end": 126.44,
    "text": " But this is different, you know?"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.44,
    "end": 136.68,
    "text": " You talk about Alzheimer's and what it does to the brain and how people can look at it"
  },
  {
    "start": 136.68,
    "end": 144.68,
    "text": " in different ways, you know, how they stigmatize without realizing that they're stigmatizing"
  },
  {
    "start": 144.68,
    "end": 145.0,
    "text": " you."
  },
  {
    "start": 145.52,
    "end": 145.72,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 145.86,
    "end": 146.44,
    "text": " There's that..."
  },
  {
    "start": 147.1,
    "end": 147.44,
    "text": " That..."
  },
  {
    "start": 147.44,
    "end": 148.18,
