  },
  {
    "start": 150.84,
    "end": 150.86,
    "text": " That..."
  },
  {
    "start": 150.86,
    "end": 157.18,
    "text": " Some people know it or not, that they look at it as you're sick instead of you're just"
  },
  {
    "start": 157.18,
    "end": 161.18,
    "text": " living with some changes, and you still have abilities."
  },
  {
    "start": 161.92000000000002,
    "end": 169.8,
    "text": " One of the things that I laugh at now, if I'm somewhere with Maureen, they walk up and"
  },
  {
    "start": 169.8,
    "end": 172.8,
    "text": " they look at her and say, hey, Maureen, how you doing?"
  },
  {
    "start": 172.86,
    "end": 179.0,
    "text": " And they look at me, and they do what I call the head tilt, and they go, so how are you?"
  },
  {
    "start": 179.0,
    "end": 180.0,
    "text": " How are you?"
  },
  {
    "start": 180.0,
    "end": 181.0,
    "text": " Well, that's..."
  },
  {
    "start": 181.0,
    "end": 182.0,
    "text": " That's..."
  },
  {
    "start": 182.0,
    "end": 183.0,
    "text": " I'm great."
  },
  {
    "start": 183.0,
    "end": 184.0,
    "text": " I'm good."
  },
  {
    "start": 184.0,
    "end": 185.0,
    "text": " Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": 185.0,
    "end": 186.0,
    "text": " Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": 186.0,
    "end": 187.0,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 187.0,
    "end": 188.0,
    "text": " And I want to say, and I can talk and understand."
  },
  {
    "start": 188.0,
    "end": 189.0,
    "text": " So, Brian, something you and I have talked about in the past is how important music is"
  },
  {
    "start": 189.0,
    "end": 190.0,
    "text": " to you, as it is to me as well."
  },
  {
    "start": 190.0,
    "end": 191.0,
    "text": " And it's been a part of you since childhood."
  },
  {
    "start": 191.0,
    "end": 192.0,
    "text": " I believe you started playing guitar at what age?"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.0,
    "end": 193.0,
    "text": " Nine."
  },
  {
