  },
  {
    "start": 238.0,
    "end": 244.58,
    "text": " that you both sang in church and that music was also really important to her and"
  },
  {
    "start": 244.58,
    "end": 255.74,
    "text": " share with us a little bit about your memory of Saturday mornings I love this yeah Saturday"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.74,
    "end": 265.22,
    "text": " mornings um now this is back in the the 60s and and 70s but uh when my mom would clean"
  },
  {
    "start": 265.22,
    "end": 274.94000000000005,
    "text": " she would put on her records and they consisted of all these uh soundtracks soundtracks from the"
  },
  {
    "start": 274.94000000000005,
    "end": 285.12,
    "text": " movies um South Pacific Fiddler on the Roof um Sound of Music um you know different different"
  },
  {
    "start": 285.12,
    "end": 293.1,
    "text": " ones but her favorite was always the go-to was always the Sound of Music yeah and so when she"
  },
  {
    "start": 293.1,
    "end": 295.20000000000005,
    "text": " was cleaning you know she"
  },
  {
    "start": 295.22,
    "end": 301.84000000000003,
    "text": " would just sing and her her voice people used to say that she had um uh she sounds"
  },
  {
    "start": 301.84000000000003,
    "end": 308.8,
    "text": " like Cinderella when she was singing you know she just had this beautiful beautiful voice"
  },
  {
    "start": 308.8,
    "end": 316.6,
    "text": " so Brian how about we try a little bit of the Sound of Music and see what's up one of"
  },
  {
    "start": 316.6,
    "end": 321.68,
    "text": " one of my favorites me too all right would you like me to start it or would you like"
  },
  {
    "start": 321.68,
    "end": 324.62,
    "text": " to start it yes I would like for you to start all right"
  },
  {
    "start": 325.22,
    "end": 337.52000000000004,
    "text": " let's go to the let's go to the classic uh the hills are alive with the sound of music"
  },
  {
    "start": 337.52000000000004,
    "end": 338.52000000000004,
    "text": " with songs"
  },
  {
    "start": 338.52000000000004,
    "end": 355.08000000000004,
    "text": " for a thousand years the hills fill my heart with the sound of music"
  },
  {
    "start": 355.22,
    "end": 358.46000000000004,
    "text": " my heart wants to sing every song"
  },
  {
    "start": 362.24,
    "end": 372.20000000000005,
    "text": " my heart wants who see like the wings of the birds from the lake to the trees"
  },
  {
    "start": 373.64000000000004,
    "end": 382.3,
    "text": " my heart wants to sigh like a chime that flies from the church on a breeze"
  },
  {
    "start": 385.22,
    "end": 398.42,
    "text": " Like a brook as it trips and trows over stones on its way to sing through the night."
  },
  {
    "start": 398.42,
    "end": 416.32,
    "text": " Like a lark who is learning to pray, I go to the hills when my heart is lonely."
  },
  {
    "start": 416.32,
    "end": 424.96000000000004,
    "text": " I know I will find what I've heard before."
  },
  {
    "start": 426.82,
    "end": 428.40000000000003,
    "text": " My heart is lonely."
  },
  {
    "start": 428.42,
    "end": 452.48,
    "text": " My heart will be blessed with the sound of music and I'll sing once more."
  },
  {
    "start": 452.48,
    "end": 454.18,
    "text": " And the crowd goes wild."
  },
  {
    "start": 454.18,
    "end": 456.82,
    "text": " Oh, Brian, thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": 456.82,
    "end": 457.82,
    "text": " Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": 457.82,
    "end": 458.32,
    "text": " Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": 458.42,
    "end": 464.92,
    "text": " See, now that should be a nice example of how we, you can use music to get socially"
  },
  {
    "start": 464.92,
    "end": 465.92,
    "text": " connected."
  },
  {
    "start": 465.92,
    "end": 468.72,
    "text": " Yes, very much so."
  },
  {
    "start": 468.72,
    "end": 469.72,
    "text": " Very much so."
  },
  {
    "start": 469.72,
    "end": 470.72,
    "text": " And here's the thing."
  },
  {
    "start": 470.72,
    "end": 476.92,
    "text": " It may not be perfect on Zoom, but that actually happened for us spontaneously a while back."
  },
  {
    "start": 476.92,
    "end": 477.92,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 477.92,
    "end": 479.92,
    "text": " And it felt so good."
  },
  {
    "start": 479.92,
    "end": 484.92,
    "text": " I know it's, it's just natural, you know."
  },
  {
    "start": 484.92,
    "end": 488.32,
    "text": " So I wanted to talk about one other really neat thing."
  },
  {
    "start": 488.32,
    "end": 495.82,
    "text": " You have going on with music that actually is another form of social collaboration."
  },
  {
    "start": 495.82,
    "end": 501.82,
    "text": " So I know you in the past, you would, you have written some of your own songs."
  },
  {
    "start": 501.82,
    "end": 502.82,
    "text": " Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 502.82,
    "end": 511.82,
    "text": " So, um, and it sounds like you've had an opportunity to make that happen again."
  },
  {
    "start": 511.82,
    "end": 512.8199999999999,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 512.8199999999999,
    "end": 514.8199999999999,
    "text": " Tell me, tell me a little bit about that."
  },
  {
    "start": 514.8199999999999,
    "end": 516.3199999999999,
    "text": " I think it's very exciting."
  },
  {
    "start": 516.3199999999999,
    "end": 517.3199999999999,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 517.3199999999999,
    "end": 518.3199999999999,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 518.32,
    "end": 524.32,
    "text": " So, um, a young lady who, um, grew up, we grew up together."
  },
  {
    "start": 524.32,
    "end": 530.32,
    "text": " Um, and we, we actually sang together and in church and so forth also."
  },
  {
    "start": 530.32,
    "end": 534.32,
    "text": " And, um, she has three sons."
  },
  {
    "start": 534.32,
    "end": 541.32,
    "text": " Her youngest son is like, uh, I think he's 17, 18 years old or maybe 20."
  },
  {
    "start": 541.32,
    "end": 542.32,
    "text": " I don't know."
  },
  {
    "start": 542.32,
    "end": 545.32,
    "text": " But he's in that, in that age range."
  },
  {
    "start": 545.32,
    "end": 547.32,
    "text": " But when his, uh, when he was 17, 18 years old."
  },
  {
    "start": 547.32,
    "end": 548.32,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 548.32,
    "end": 550.32,
    "text": " And he was talking with his mom."
  },
  {
    "start": 550.32,
    "end": 555.32,
    "text": " She told him about my Alzheimer's and so forth."
  },
  {
    "start": 555.32,
    "end": 564.32,
    "text": " And, um, and then we, we started conversing, uh, her son and I, and, uh, and I, I asked"
  },
  {
    "start": 564.32,
    "end": 571.32,
    "text": " him, I said, listen, I said, I really want to write a song about Alzheimer's."
  },
  {
    "start": 571.32,
    "end": 577.32,
    "text": " I said, if I write the lyrics to the song, would you mind putting it to music?"
  },
  {
    "start": 577.32,
    "end": 578.32,
    "text": " Excuse me."
  },
  {
    "start": 578.32,
    "end": 579.32,
    "text": " And he said, oh man."
  },
  {
    "start": 579.32,
    "end": 580.32,
    "text": " He said, I would love to do that."
  },
  {
    "start": 580.32,
    "end": 581.32,
    "text": " So I'm really looking forward to seeing what happens when I've heard a lot of music, not"
  },
  {
    "start": 581.32,
    "end": 582.32,
    "text": " a lot, but there have been some songs written about Alzheimer's, but most of them are from"
  },
  {
    "start": 582.32,
    "end": 583.32,
    "text": " someone, the point of view of someone outside of it."
  },
  {
    "start": 583.32,
    "end": 584.32,
    "text": " Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 584.32,
    "end": 585.32,
    "text": " From the outside looking in."
  },
  {
    "start": 585.32,
    "end": 586.32,
    "text": " Looking in."
  },
  {
    "start": 586.32,
    "end": 587.32,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
